1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOdtwioWGj_nfKQb-QaN-Tt2PNqUAcSh7PAatV0m-eIlA&oe=6ABFBDF9"}, "display_name": "Supernatural \u2013 Legacy Edition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Wishlist the new Supernatural now!** \n\n\ud83c\udf81 Supernatural is moving to a new app this fall. Wishlist the new Supernatural now so you\u2019re ready when it launches:\n\n**<https://sn.co/wl-legacypdp>** \n\n\ud83c\udf1f The new Supernatural brings fresh workouts, new music, higher-definition environments, and the coaches you know, with an independent team continuing to build what comes next.                                                         \n                                                                                                                    \n{1466546911425769}\n\n\ud83d\udce2 **Stay connected** \n\nHear from the coaches and follow updates on the new Supernatural at:\n<https://www.wearesupernatural.com/pdp>\n\n\n**You can also join the official Supernatural Facebook community:**\n\n<https://www.facebook.com/groups/getsupernatural/>\n\n\n**Supernatural - Legacy Edition is winding down**\n\nThe current Supernatural experience will remain available through December 3, 2026.\n\n\n**For questions about your membership, contact:**\n\nsupport@getsupernatural.com\n\n\n\n\nThank you for being part of Supernatural and for everything you\u2019ve built with us. We hope to see you in the new Supernatural this fall.\n\n", "short_description": "Your Supernatural experience is moving to a new app this fall. \n\nWishlist the new Supernatural now for fresh workouts, new music, higher-definition environments, and everything the independent Supernatural team is building next: sn.co/wl-legacypdp\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Within Unlimited, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.getsupernatural.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.getsupernatural.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Within Unlimited, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.